This repository's current main branch already includes VDR-Suite HbbTV code.
For direct Git-tree Debian binary builds only the two Seahawk compatibility
patches listed in debian/patches/series are applied. Historical HbbTV patches
0001-0004 MUST NOT be applied again to this Git snapshot.

The independent packaging/seahawk/prepare-source.sh reproducibly constructs
an old, checksum-pinned Seahawk upstream source and appends all four HbbTV
patches to that original source. Those patches remain in the tree exclusively
for that historical, isolated quilt-source regeneration path.

The source format is 3.0 (quilt). Publishing a Git snapshot and ensuring the
correct orig.tar provenance/version requires a separate source-package gate;
a successful binary build alone is NOT approval to publish a Launchpad Recipe
from main. Never auto-upload or modify a running VDR installation.
